\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -167\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Birgitta Suecica}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Revelationes}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Erste Redaktion ('Liber Alfonsi'), Auszug (li. IV-V). (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -124\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Li. IV (cap. 1-130). (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis (Auszug der Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften); Kap. 9-11 gestrichen; bricht in Kapitel 11 ab. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Titel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Verba Johannis ewangeliste ad sponsam, qualiter}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit quartus liber revelacionum beate Birgitte. Capitulum primum<. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Apparuit sponse persona quedam, cuius crines videbantur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 ... \plain \f0\i\fs22 - ... sedebit cum iudicantibus orbem. >Et sic est finis quarti libri. Explicit quartus liber celestium revelacionum Sancte Birgitte et iam incipit quintus liber<.\plain \f0\fs22  (124\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -156\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Li. V. (124\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -125\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Incipit quintus liber celestium revelacionum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... prout alios libros transplantare \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 solitus erat.\plain \f0\fs22  (125\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -156\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vidi thronum in celo}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ostedam tibi plura. >Et sic est finis huius quinti libri revelacionum celestium beate Birgitte sponse Christi domini nostri<.\plain \f0\fs22  (156\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -167\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Register (li. IV-V). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancta Birgitta, Revelaciones 4, 1992}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 59-371 ('Liber Alphonsi', dat. Italien, 1377). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 17-58, v.a. 32-41 (Hs nicht genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancta Birgitta, Revelaciones 5, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 97-175 ('Liber Alfonsi', dat. Italien, 1377). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 13-66 (Hs nicht genannt).}

