\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 167\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -172\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de interdicto, suspensione et excommunicatione}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Iam incipit utilis Tractatus de interdicto, suspensione et excommunicacione, qui multum valet nescientibus iura<\plain \f0\fs22 . (168\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia ignorancia facti alieni probabilis regulariter quem excusat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... non que facere in premissis quis debeat et se in hoc sic exhibeat sicud omnipotenti Deo sancte et individue sacrificare et paternam suam hereditatem finaliter possidere affectat cum >Christo<, qui cum benedicta matre sua virgine >Maria< sit benedictus in secula seculorum. >Amen<.\plain \f0\fs22  \u220 \'dcberlieferung (fr\u252 \'fchester Textzeuge!) auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Marburg, UB, Mscr. 75}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 243\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -246\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (Magdeburg, Bursfelde, 1465-1472), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kat. Marburg}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 226 (Verfasserzuschreibung an Johannes Calderinus haltlos); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Berlin, SB, Ms. Magdeb. 29}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 192\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -195\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  (Magdeburg, Dominikaner, 1472 u.a.), vgl. Kat. B Magdeb. 1, S. 106; Berlin, SB, Ms. theol. lat. qu. 354 (Mitteldeutschland, letztes V. 15. Jh.), 235\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -239\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (Abweichungen am Ende?), vgl. Berlin SB Kat. 1.2 (1984), S. 195; Hannover, LKA, S 6 Nr. 54 (Oldenbrok bei Bremen, 1472), 92\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -95\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. Kurzkatalog Niedersachsen 1, 1991, S. 149.}

