\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 191\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -192\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo in Lc 22,15}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Desiderio desideravi ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Lc 22,15)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 <. Licet hoc nomine pascha intelligitur vespera ymolacionis. Scitis quod post biduum pascha fiet}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17  (Mt 26,2)}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... videamus verba dicentis: >Desiderio desideravi ... verba thematis propositi. Rogemus dominum etc.<}
